      "altDraft": "starterのproject rootをwatchして先頭から実行しているWeb Preview",
      "gates": ["dsl4-release", "tutorial-sample", "preview-flow"]
    },
    {
      "id": "C-05",
      "tutorial": "create",
      "step": 4,
      "required": true,
      "status": "blocked",
      "surface": "development reload dialog",
      "description": "YAML保存後のreload選択dialog",
      "filename": "docs/images/tutorials/dsl4/create/tutorial-create-05-reload-dialog.png",
      "captionDraft": "変更後のsourceをどの位置から再開するか選びます。",
      "altDraft": "先頭、現在のscene、現在のactionからの再開候補を示すreload dialog",
      "gates": ["dsl4-release", "tutorial-sample", "preview-flow"]
    },
    {
      "id": "C-06",
      "tutorial": "create",
      "step": 4,
      "required": true,
      "status": "blocked",
      "surface": "development preview",
      "description": "セリフ変更が反映されたpreview",
      "filename": "docs/images/tutorials/dsl4/create/tutorial-create-06-updated-dialogue.png",
      "captionDraft": "YAMLで変更したセリフがpreviewへ反映されたことを確認します。",
      "altDraft": "変更後のセリフをアクターが表示しているdevelopment preview",
      "gates": ["dsl4-release", "tutorial-sample", "preview-flow"]
    },
    {
      "id": "C-07",
      "tutorial": "create",
      "step": 5,
      "required": true,
      "status": "blocked",
      "surface": "text editor file tree",
      "description": "projectへcopyした新しい背景とcostumeのfile",
      "filename": "docs/images/tutorials/dsl4/create/tutorial-create-07-added-files.png",
      "captionDraft": "addition kitの背景とcostumeをproject rootへcopyします。",
      "altDraft": "新しい背景とcostumeのfileがroot直下へ追加されたstarterのファイルツリー",
      "gates": ["dsl4-release", "tutorial-sample", "preview-flow", "capture-environment"]
    },
    {
      "id": "C-08",
      "tutorial": "create",
      "step": 5,
      "required": true,
      "status": "blocked",
      "surface": "development asset reload dialog",
      "description": "sourceと新規追加assetのcandidate差分と再開位置",
